{"id":"873303ae0d44ae55","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-ruled.md","title":"Ruled Variety","display":"df-ruled — Ruled Variety","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ruled","aliases":["58-df-ruled"],"display":"df-ruled — Ruled Variety","depends_on":["[[58-df-variety]]","[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-ring-homomorphism]]","[[58-df-bijective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ruled"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ruled</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ruled — Ruled Variety"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"621e8d7c1c15f553\" href=\"?note=621e8d7c1c15f553\" title=\"58-df-variety\">58-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28f002080d71355a\" href=\"?note=28f002080d71355a\" title=\"58-df-ring-homomorphism\">58-df-ring-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\((k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> is a chosen field structure and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is an irreducible affine <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-variety.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K_{X/k,n}\">\\(\\mathbb K_{X/k,n}\\)</span> denotes the canonical fraction-field datum of the coordinate domain of the displayed affine presentation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq k^n\">\\(X\\subseteq k^n\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K_{Y/k,m}(t)\">\\(\\mathbb K_{Y/k,m}(t)\\)</span> is its one-variable rational-function-field extension.</li>\n<li>For a field datum <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K=\\langle K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb K=\\langle K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K}\\rangle\\)</span>, write <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbb K|=K\">\\(|\\mathbb K|=K\\)</span> for its carrier. The maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{X/k,n}\">\\(\\iota_{X/k,n}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{Y/k,m,t}\">\\(\\iota_{Y/k,m,t}\\)</span> are the canonical constant-field embeddings.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldIsomorphismOver}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldIsomorphismOver}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ruled}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ruled}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ruled\\text{-}field\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S(\\mathbb K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb K=\\langle|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K}\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ruled\\text{-}field\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S(\\mathbb K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb K=\\langle|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K}\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ruled\\text{-}field\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}over}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FieldIsomorphismOver}_S(h,\\mathbb K,\\mathbb L,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\iota_{\\mathbb K},\\iota_{\\mathbb L})\n\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\n\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S(\\mathbb K)\\land\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S(\\mathbb L)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(\\iota_{\\mathbb K},k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\n|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(\\iota_{\\mathbb L},k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\n|\\mathbb L|,+_{\\mathbb L},\\cdot_{\\mathbb L},0_{\\mathbb L},1_{\\mathbb L})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(h,|\\mathbb K|,|\\mathbb L|)\n\\land\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(h,|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K},\n|\\mathbb L|,+_{\\mathbb L},\\cdot_{\\mathbb L},0_{\\mathbb L},1_{\\mathbb L})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in k\\;(h(\\iota_{\\mathbb K}(a))=\\iota_{\\mathbb L}(a))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ruled\\text{-}field\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}over}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FieldIsomorphismOver}_S(h,\\mathbb K,\\mathbb L,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\iota_{\\mathbb K},\\iota_{\\mathbb L})\n\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\n\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S(\\mathbb K)\\land\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S(\\mathbb L)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(\\iota_{\\mathbb K},k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\n|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(\\iota_{\\mathbb L},k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\n|\\mathbb L|,+_{\\mathbb L},\\cdot_{\\mathbb L},0_{\\mathbb L},1_{\\mathbb L})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(h,|\\mathbb K|,|\\mathbb L|)\n\\land\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(h,|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K},\n|\\mathbb L|,+_{\\mathbb L},\\cdot_{\\mathbb L},0_{\\mathbb L},1_{\\mathbb L})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in k\\;(h(\\iota_{\\mathbb K}(a))=\\iota_{\\mathbb L}(a))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ruled}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ruled}_S(X,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left[\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\n\\exists Y\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists h\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(Y;k,m,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{FieldIsomorphismOver}_S\\!\\left(\nh,\\mathbb K_{X/k,n},\\mathbb K_{Y/k,m}(t),k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\n\\iota_{X/k,n},\\iota_{Y/k,m,t}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ruled}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ruled}_S(X,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left[\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\n\\exists Y\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists h\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(Y;k,m,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{FieldIsomorphismOver}_S\\!\\left(\nh,\\mathbb K_{X/k,n},\\mathbb K_{Y/k,m}(t),k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\n\\iota_{X/k,n},\\iota_{Y/k,m,t}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For irreducible affine varieties, the displayed function-field isomorphism is equivalent to a birational equivalence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\dashrightarrow Y\\times_k\\mathbb P_k^1\">\\(X\\dashrightarrow Y\\times_k\\mathbb P_k^1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The complete base-field structure and the two constant-field embeddings are explicit in the registered isomorphism predicate; the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_k\">\\(\\cong_k\\)</span> symbol had no selected maps or operations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"621e8d7c1c15f553","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"28f002080d71355a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K_{X/k,n}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq k^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K_{Y/k,m}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K=\\langle K,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbb K|=K","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_{X/k,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_{Y/k,m,t}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingHom}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FieldIsomorphismOver}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ruled}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ruled\\text{-}field\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S(\\mathbb K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb K=\\langle|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K}\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ruled\\text{-}field\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}over}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FieldIsomorphismOver}_S(h,\\mathbb K,\\mathbb L,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\\iota_{\\mathbb K},\\iota_{\\mathbb L})\n\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\n\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S(\\mathbb K)\\land\\mathrm{FieldDatum}_S(\\mathbb L)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(\\iota_{\\mathbb K},k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\n|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(\\iota_{\\mathbb L},k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\n|\\mathbb L|,+_{\\mathbb L},\\cdot_{\\mathbb L},0_{\\mathbb L},1_{\\mathbb L})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(h,|\\mathbb K|,|\\mathbb L|)\n\\land\\mathrm{RingHom}_S(h,|\\mathbb K|,+_{\\mathbb K},\\cdot_{\\mathbb K},0_{\\mathbb K},1_{\\mathbb K},\n|\\mathbb L|,+_{\\mathbb L},\\cdot_{\\mathbb L},0_{\\mathbb L},1_{\\mathbb L})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall a\\in k\\;(h(\\iota_{\\mathbb K}(a))=\\iota_{\\mathbb L}(a))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ruled}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ruled}_S(X,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left[\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(X;k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\n\\exists Y\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists h\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{AffineVariety}_S(Y;k,m,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{FieldIsomorphismOver}_S\\!\\left(\nh,\\mathbb K_{X/k,n},\\mathbb K_{Y/k,m}(t),k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,\n\\iota_{X/k,n},\\iota_{Y/k,m,t}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"X\\dashrightarrow Y\\times_k\\mathbb P_k^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong_k","display":false}],"bytes":3311,"backlinks":[{"id":"2bacbc1cfb1a8f2d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"No dependency on [[58-df-ruled]] is used here: that atom defines ruled algebraic varieties, not ruled surfaces in elementary differential geometry."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ruled.md|58-df-ruled]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["621e8d7c1c15f553","1eb4a89b005d9cda","28f002080d71355a","d583890235faf0d5"]}